# Client material — never publish. Pipeline runs contain the client's requirements and the
# generated solution; input/ holds their Functional Designs. Both were previously only
# UNTRACKED, so a single `git add -A` would have committed a client document. Ignore the
# folders and allow-list the two bundled examples that ship with the tool.
output/
input/*
